# Neural DSP Quad Cortex and Quad Cortex mini (and other Neural DSP USB devices)
# Grants the local session user access to the HID control channel,
# which Wine (winebus, hidraw backend) forwards to Cortex Control.
# 152a is Thesycon's vendor ID, shared with other audio brands: also match the
# manufacturer string. Only hidraw is opened: Cortex Control does not need raw USB.
# The number must stay below 73: the uaccess tag is applied by 73-seat-late.rules.
SUBSYSTEM=="hidraw", ATTRS{idVendor}=="152a", ATTRS{manufacturer}=="Neural DSP", TAG+="uaccess"
